  "description": "Legal AI Skills by Rohas Nagpal is a free, open-source AI law firm: a Managing Partner, 17 Specialist Lawyers, India, US and UK Jurisdiction Counsel, 226 legal skills, 20 workflows, official legal-research connectors, company registries, deadline and interest calculators, sanctions-list screening, and local document production.",
  "author": {
    "name": "Rohas Nagpal",
    "email": "rohasnagpal@gmail.com",
    "url": "https://rohasnagpal.com"
  },
  "homepage": "https://www.rohasnagpal.com/legal-ai-skills.php",
